            name: "Methley",
            category: "Plum varieties adapted to Texas",
            harvest_time_unparsed: "Methley ripens from late May to early June.",
            description: "Methley ripens from late May to early June. The fruit is small to medium size with a mottled purple peel and juicy red flesh that is sweet and flavorful (Figs 3 and 4). It is adapted across Texas but is soft and does not store well. It is self-fruitful and readily pollinates other plums"
        },
